      "en": "The sun also rises, and the sun goes down, and hurries to its place where it rises.",
      "ko": "해는 떴다가 지며 그 떴던 곳으로 빨리 돌아가고",
      "source_text_hash": "d0213331618e56862e35410834bd541714ecc163f549f7ff29091834d1dbb24c",
      "translation_text_hash": "081be6b3f14520bac43d3c8db23d39c4bc7b48be70397996a4e5f98083c4651c",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
