      "en": "Is there a thing of which it may be said, “Behold, this is new”? It has been long ago, in the ages which were before us.",
      "ko": "무엇을 가리켜 이르기를 보라 이것이 새 것이라 할 것이 있으랴 우리 오래 전 세대에도 이미 있었느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "d1e8b4628db12aaa6e9041af1100388be28f4c512a08a0cf606105a45c260d4a",
      "translation_text_hash": "39b451f4def7277dae57bc5bc4c5a73a9910aba32769605e7749509e7e98ee82",
